!Name: c12d-glider-shuttle
!C A pair of Cordership convoys which recede from each other while
!C building glider-LWSS fuses which shuttle a glider back and forth
!C between the ends while generating two staggered LWSS streams.
!C If desired, a second glider can be inserted in the obvious place
!C to make the reaction twice as fast and symmetric.
!C David I. Bell, 19 January 2010
